# A dedicated `catalog` schema within the same SQL Server database as the
# backend - still fully separate tables/migration history, reached only
# over this service's API, same isolation idea as a separate database. The
# schema itself is selected in code (app/db.py's schema_translate_map), not
# in this URL - see app/config.py's CATALOG_SCHEMA.
DATABASE_URL=mssql+pyodbc://voiceorder:changeme@localhost/voiceorder?driver=ODBC+Driver+18+for+SQL+Server&TrustServerCertificate=yes
# Shared secret the backend must send as X-API-Key. Blank means the check
# is a no-op (same convention as the backend's own api_key setting) -
# fine for local dev, set this before deploying anywhere the port is
# reachable beyond localhost/trusted LAN.
API_KEY=
